  "name": "Asphyxiate",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/daze.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Shadowy tendrils extend from you and swirl around the throat of a creature you can see within range. The target must make a successful Constitution saving throw or be restrained and incapacitated for the spells duration. While restrained in this way, the target is unable to speak. At the end of each of its turns, the target can make another Constitution saving throw. On a success, the spell ends on the target.</p>",
